# ACC single-task floor

For NeXT (and other) gated ACC queues: if **any** finished task’s relative ACC vs Dense is **&lt; 88%**, immediately `SKIP_6ACC` that arm — do not finish remaining R4 tasks or extras. Default gate: `--single-floor 88` (was 85). R4 mean gate stays 92.
